        "created_at": "2019-02-23T16:34:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Now to wait for the day that GTG is ready to hand out the Character Creation chapter...</p>\n<p>Once that happens, I'll probably see about running my friends through the starter-kit adventures with their own characters. They get why, but they weren't too keen on trying it out if the character creation rules weren't included in it.</p>",
