      {
        "id": 225386,
        "name": "JesterOC",
        "username": "JesterOC",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/4bbf92/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-02-23T18:38:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…they get why, but they weren’t too keen on trying it out if the character creation rules weren’t included in it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same boat. We did play a one shot, but my rpg friends for the most part have not played sentinels of the multiverse so getting into the roles of freedom five was a bit off putting.</p>\n<p>Character creation rules will be the extra push I need.</p>",
