        "created_at": "2019-02-28T01:48:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, Muerto is a divided archetype and <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Bunker</span> is Modular. I’d need to read both to figure out which be more towards a Kamen Rider motif mechanically.</p>",
