      {
        "id": 225396,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-12T10:28:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Bigbywolfe\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bigbywolfe:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The estimated delivery for the PDF is 5 months away and that date has been set since the Kickstarter began. How are people complaining about waiting already?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Some folks want the character generation chapter early. I believe that’s what they are asking about.</p>",
